Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 17:34:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix robot description discovery when move_group has no
 description parameters

Some MoveIt configurations, such as Universal Robots' ur_moveit_config, give
move_group its URDF and SRDF only on the latched robot_description and
robot_description_semantic topics. move_group then has no parameters to
return, and RobotDescription.from_node failed with "Invalid response from
'move_group/get_parameters'", so the examples could not start.

Fall back to the latched topics of the same names when the parameters are
missing or empty.
---
 pymoveit2/robot_description.py | 107 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------
 test/test_robot_description.py |  43 ++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 127 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/pymoveit2/robot_description.py b/pymoveit2/robot_description.py
index a207a97..a3753e1 100644
--- a/pymoveit2/robot_description.py
